{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 21727, "game_id": 202, "entry_id": 21103, "uid": 24855, "type": 4, "title": "【国际服】还魂推荐榜", "tag": "0", "created_at": 1577433190, "updated_at": 1631090517, "updated_uid": 0, "comment_at": 1589710380, "last_at": 0, "comment_count": 7, "status": 1, "summary": "本文首发于：https://bbs.nga.cn/read.php?&tid=19801736作者Enko是我本人。前言：国际服于26日开启了玛瑙还魂，不要红石，不要黄花，只要998！！只要玛瑙。这无", "thumb": "", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 14, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 45396, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 0, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 0, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 21727, "content": "<div data-reset=\"true\">本文首发于：<a href=\"https://bbs.nga.cn/read.php?&amp;tid=19801736\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">https://bbs.nga.cn/read.php?&amp;tid=19801736</a></div><div data-reset=\"true\">作者Enko 是我本人。</div><div data-reset=\"true\"><br data-reset=\"true\"></div><div data-reset=\"true\">前言：国际服于26日开启了玛瑙还魂，不要红石，不要黄花， 只要998！！ 只要玛瑙。这无论对于大佬还是萌新来说都是一场狂欢。下午五点，随着各大qq群里的统一公告——冲！！！，所有人都在半个小时内，清空了自己一年多的库存，紧接着一阵索然无味……</div><div data-reset=\"true\"><br data-reset=\"true\"></div><div data-reset=\"true\">对于那些仓鼠大佬，终于可以清空那些占格子的五星、开那几十张库存得发霉的猪皇券了，强迫症得到了巨大的满足。萌新们也砸锅卖铁，高加甚至P了自己一直想要的角色，更有氪金狼人，直接买了自选包再丢进去还魂。一时间群魔乱舞，还魂还到魂飞魄散……</div><div data-reset=\"true\"><br data-reset=\"true\"></div><div data-reset=\"true\">好了，骚话到此为止，同学们还魂过后，都有了以下症状：红石没了，玛瑙没了，金币也快没了，五星没了，四星也用光了；最重要的是，好像发现自己没有变强多少……</div><div data-reset=\"true\"><br data-reset=\"true\"></div><div data-reset=\"true\">国际服资源实在有限，所以同学们在还魂的时候，需要找到自己收益最高的方式。这一次清空了不要紧，因为从+0到P需要还魂6次，这才刚刚开始。还魂是常驻活动，同学们要做好规划。下面，我就以PVP向为基础，兼顾接下来的各大活动，做一个主观的还魂推荐表。同学们可以对照自己的box来参考，因为每个人的box都不一样。你P了你就跳过，还魂下一个就行了。</div><div data-reset=\"true\"><br data-reset=\"true\"></div><div data-reset=\"true\">以下排名只分组，组内排名不分先后，因为还魂一次能放6个天子。</div><div data-reset=\"true\"><br data-reset=\"true\"></div><div data-reset=\"true\">T0：嫦娥、木伞、木莫娜、海王星(我不说你们也知道，国际服四大铁人权)</div><div data-reset=\"true\"><div><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1578404598098_51563355.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1578404598098_51563355.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_800,w_800\" style=\"width: 90px; height: 89px;\" alt=\"【国际服】还魂推荐榜\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1578404617528_20399840.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1578404617528_20399840.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_800,w_800\" style=\"font-size: 14px; width: 90px; height: 89px;\" alt=\"【国际服】还魂推荐榜\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1578404684386_11524062.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1578404684386_11524062.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_800,w_800\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\" alt=\"【国际服】还魂推荐榜\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1578404702367_30824976.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1578404702367_30824976.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_800,w_800\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\" alt=\"【国际服】还魂推荐榜\"></div><br data-reset=\"true\"></div><div data-reset=\"true\">T1：伊芙、教皇、泡面、傻白、暗独眼(PVE)、魔方、排球、妮可、蛇萝、暗基佬(PVP)、水裤裤(新出的还魂馆天子，值得还魂一张开图鉴，用法以后有待开发。)</div><div data-reset=\"true\"><div><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1577441014911_82089848.png\" alt=\"【国际服】还魂推荐榜\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1577440704439_40151728.png\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\" alt=\"【国际服】还魂推荐榜\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1578404770419_79185514.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1578404770419_79185514.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_800,w_800\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\" alt=\"【国际服】还魂推荐榜\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1578404793654_97386732.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1578404793654_97386732.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_800,w_800\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\" alt=\"【国际服】还魂推荐榜\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1578404803203_53748954.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1578404803203_53748954.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_800,w_800\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\" alt=\"【国际服】还魂推荐榜\"></div><div><br></div><div><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1578404814422_61416445.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1578404814422_61416445.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_800,w_800\" style=\"font-size: 14px; width: 90px; height: 89px;\" alt=\"【国际服】还魂推荐榜\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1578404838159_8713904.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1578404838159_8713904.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_800,w_800\" style=\"font-size: 14px; width: 90px; height: 89px;\" alt=\"【国际服】还魂推荐榜\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1578404848257_7279510.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1578404848257_7279510.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_800,w_800\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\" alt=\"【国际服】还魂推荐榜\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1578404856586_98603799.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1578404856586_98603799.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_800,w_800\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\" alt=\"【国际服】还魂推荐榜\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1578404864030_24901209.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1578404864030_24901209.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_800,w_800\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\" alt=\"【国际服】还魂推荐榜\"><div><br></div><div><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1578404873656_61614582.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1578404873656_61614582.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_800,w_800\" style=\"width: 89px; height: 88px;\" alt=\"【国际服】还魂推荐榜\"></div></div><br data-reset=\"true\"></div><div data-reset=\"true\">T2：艳后、木炮、糖猫、提箱、火双刃、木丽莎、火莫纳、光奶、水泡、木基佬</div><div data-reset=\"true\"><div><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1578404958423_61126870.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1578404958423_61126870.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_800,w_800\" alt=\"【国际服】还魂推荐榜\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1578404969124_96307036.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1578404969124_96307036.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_800,w_800\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\" alt=\"【国际服】还魂推荐榜\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1578404983049_6816758.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1578404983049_6816758.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_800,w_800\" style=\"font-size: 14px; width: 90px; height: 90px;\" alt=\"【国际服】还魂推荐榜\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1578404991819_48226230.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1578404991819_48226230.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_800,w_800\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\" alt=\"【国际服】还魂推荐榜\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1578404998092_68007988.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1578404998092_68007988.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_800,w_800\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\" alt=\"【国际服】还魂推荐榜\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1578405019363_53116524.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1578405019363_53116524.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_800,w_800\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\" alt=\"【国际服】还魂推荐榜\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1578405028120_10988728.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1578405028120_10988728.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_800,w_800\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\" alt=\"【国际服】还魂推荐榜\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1578405041891_20920128.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1578405041891_20920128.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_800,w_800\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\" alt=\"【国际服】还魂推荐榜\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1578405051668_9311705.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1578405051668_9311705.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_800,w_800\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\" alt=\"【国际服】还魂推荐榜\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1578405058971_38651228.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1578405058971_38651228.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_800,w_800\" style=\"font-size: 14px; width: 90px; height: 89px;\" alt=\"【国际服】还魂推荐榜\"></div><br data-reset=\"true\"></div><div data-reset=\"true\">T3：……你tm真的有这么多5星去还魂？？你能还完楼上那些就不用看这个榜了。</div><div data-reset=\"true\"><br data-reset=\"true\"></div><div data-reset=\"true\">没提到的，最近基本用不上，或者只是一次两次能用上，没有必要追求高加。先把楼上这些还魂完吧。</div><div data-reset=\"true\"><br data-reset=\"true\"></div><div data-reset=\"true\">最后，单独说一下联动。没把联动列进去是因为她的特殊性，大部分人都不全甚至一个没有，对于有的人特别是全联动来说，还魂联动是最优先的，因为别的都可以歪得出来，联动只能靠还魂，所以任何时候还魂都不亏。</div><div data-reset=\"true\"><br data-reset=\"true\"></div><div data-reset=\"true\">这里只列出我觉得很有用的联动天子，他们的强度没法说T几。因为有些会颠覆jjc，有些pve打法上也会有变动。君不见昨天刚开的还魂，今天pvp榜一已经上P魔女了。以前榜上联动少不是因为她们不强，而是绝少有人联动高加，没有开发出相应体系。所以有联动的朋友，且还且珍惜。</div><div data-reset=\"true\"><br data-reset=\"true\"></div><div data-reset=\"true\">推荐还魂联动：魔女、诚、霞、公主初音、罗斯。</div><div data-reset=\"true\"><div><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1578405118218_14716115.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1578405118218_14716115.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_800,w_800\" style=\"width: 89px; height: 86px;\" alt=\"【国际服】还魂推荐榜\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1578405128243_47642935.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1578405128243_47642935.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_800,w_800\" style=\"font-size: 14px; width: 89px; height: 86px;\" alt=\"【国际服】还魂推荐榜\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1578405135696_85025828.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1578405135696_85025828.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_800,w_800\" style=\"font-size: 14px; width: 90px; height: 89px;\" alt=\"【国际服】还魂推荐榜\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1578405143301_7117371.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1578405143301_7117371.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_800,w_800\" style=\"font-size: 14px; width: 90px; height: 90px;\" alt=\"【国际服】还魂推荐榜\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1578405152849_21573773.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1578405152849_21573773.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_800,w_800\" style=\"font-size: 14px; width: 90px; height: 89px;\" alt=\"【国际服】还魂推荐榜\"></div><br data-reset=\"true\"></div><div data-reset=\"true\">其他联动有待开发，不知道还魂谁的时候丢上去准没错，反正不会亏。</div><div data-reset=\"true\"><br data-reset=\"true\"></div><div data-reset=\"true\">最后，祝大家9%池天天四开猪皇~(用来还魂，现在的猪皇你已经高攀不起了^^)</div><br data-reset=\"true\">", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": null, "model_list": [], "user": {"uid": 24855, "username": "EA", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/11.png", "description": "", "follow_num": 9, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 0, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 0, "content_at": 0, "content_num": 3, "read_num": 153670, "like_num": 55}, "update_user": {"uid": 0, "username": "", "avatar": "", "description": "", "follow_num": 0, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 0, "is_super": false, "status": 0, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 0, "content_at": 0, "content_num": 0, "read_num": 0, "like_num": 0}, "game": {"id": 202, "name": "天命之子", "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1600339074877_54241879.png?x-image-process=image/